# Dolos .gitignore

## Project-local documentation (not tracked)
CLAUDE.md
DECISIONS.md
PLAN.md

## Dev docs (local Mythic reference cache)
dev_docs/

## Read-only reference code (never tracked)
reference_code/

## Dev artifacts
install_test*.txt
*.log
tools/
screenshots/

## Dev tooling
# dev_tools/  # now tracked — test harness lives here
mythic-mcp-conf.json
.mcp.json
.claude/

## Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
Payload_Type/dolos/__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

## OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

## Secrets
.env

## Local debug config (gitignored — use template)
rabbitmq_config.local.json

## Jupyter notebooks (testing only)
*.ipynb

## Root-level dev files (moved to dev_tools/)
/encoder_v2.py
/shellcode_test.py
.venv/
dev_examples/

## Config secrets — never track private keys or operator-modified profiles
## The boilerplate configs in Payload_Type/dolos/configs/ ARE tracked (sample only).
## Operators put real keys/profiles on the server — those are never committed.
Payload_Type/dolos/configs/encoders/*/id_*
Payload_Type/dolos/configs/encoders/*/ssh_key
Payload_Type/dolos/configs/encoders/*/*/id_*
Payload_Type/dolos/configs/encoders/*/*/ssh_key
Payload_Type/dolos/configs/ssh_keys/*/id_*
Payload_Type/dolos/configs/ssh_keys/*/ssh_key
!Payload_Type/dolos/configs/ssh_keys/*/*.pub
!Payload_Type/dolos/configs/encoders/*/*.pub
!Payload_Type/dolos/configs/encoders/*/*/*.pub
Payload_Type/dolos/configs/encoders/*/bypass_profiles/*.json
Payload_Type/dolos/configs/encoders/*/*/bypass_profiles/*.json
Payload_Type/dolos/rabbitmq_config.local.json